OL,3,GNEWSAWars, crashes and closed borders -
OL,4,Amy quest to visit every Belfast in the
OL,5,Aworld
OL,6,
OL,7,F"With all the hiccups, all the wars,
OL,8,Fpeople seemed intent on stopping me
OL,9,Fgetting places."
OL,11,FSean Drysdale thinks there are at least
OL,12,F26 different places across the world
OL,13,Fwith the name Belfast and his quest to
OL,14,Fvisit every one of them was never going
OL,15,Fto be simple.
OL,17,FThe difficulty level only increased
OL,18,Fwhen he decided he wanted to complete
OL,19,Fit on a motorbike built in the 1970s.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
