OL,3,GNEWSAWars, crashes and closed borders -
OL,4,Amy quest to visit every Belfast in the
OL,5,Aworld
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first leg of his journey in 2023
OL,8,Ftook him through Africa to visit
OL,9,FBelfast, South Africa, then it was off
OL,10,Fto north America to tick off the19
OL,11,FBelfasts there.
